<title>USA: Outlook Group Corp Q3 Feb 28 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Outlook Group Corp Q3 Feb 28 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MENASHA, Wis. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.07     loss	 $0.25</p>
<p> Net loss		     341     loss	 1,169</p>
<p> Revs			17,658		   20,181</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,649		    4,649</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 results include loss from discontinued operations of $52,000 or $0.01/shr vs loss of $96,000 or $0.02/shr.</p>
<p>1996 period ended February 29.  </p>
<p>		  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 0.37     loss	 $0.34</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,738     loss	 1,604</p>
<p> Revs			55,201		   60,825</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,649		    4,666</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month results include loss from discontinued operations of $977,000 or $0.21/shr vs gain of $249,000 or $0.05/shr.</p>
<p>Year-ago results restated to classify company's Outlook Foods Inc subsidiary as a discontinued operation.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
